{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-2964283","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【创作】2016年创作者必读书","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"增田顺一推荐罗杰·卡约瓦《游戏与人类》，从四种游戏形式出发，看见生活与创作的广阔世界。","date":"2016-04-25","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · クリエイター必読書","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · クリエイター必読書","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2964283.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160502062509id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2964283.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","ものづくり","本"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":279,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-2964283/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2964283/001-2c5efcdf3a.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[530,776],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"增田顺一推荐罗杰·卡约瓦《游戏与人类》，从四种游戏形式出发，看见生活与创作的广阔世界。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\n给所有创作者\n\n一定要读一读！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n罗杰·卡约瓦\n\n（Roger Caillois)\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n《游戏与人类》\n\n（<em>Les jeux et les hommes</em> ）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2964283/001-2c5efcdf3a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2964283/001-2c5efcdf3a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"530\" height=\"776\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n“游戏”\n\n1）竞争（阿贡）\n\n2）偶然（阿莱亚）\n\n3）模仿（拟态）\n\n4）眩晕（伊林克斯）\n\n书中以这四类进行了分类和考察\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n所有的游戏\n\n都属于这四类\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n读了这本书\n\n就能理解这个世界\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n不只是游戏\n还有社交平台上的关注和“点赞”\n电视节目　体育运动\n彩票　蹦极\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n增田读到这里时……\n这个世界\n原来竟是由这么多游戏构成的啊！\n\n我这才真正意识到！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n给游戏创作者，当然不用说\n也希望许多创作者们\n都能读一读这本书！\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见啦！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n\nものを作る人に\n\n必ず読んで欲しい！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nロジェ・カイヨワ\n\n（Roger Caillois)\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n『遊びと人間』\n\n（<em>Les jeux et les hommes</em> ）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2964283/001-2c5efcdf3a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2964283/001-2c5efcdf3a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"530\" height=\"776\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n「遊び」を\n\n1) 競争（アゴーン）\n\n2) 偶然（アレア）\n\n3) 模倣（ミミクリー）\n\n4) めまい（イリンクス）\n\nに分類して考察されてます\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nすべての遊びは\n\nこの4つの中に入ります\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこれを読むと\n\n世の中が分かります\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nゲームだけでなく\nSNSのフォローや\"いいね\" \nテレビ番組  スポーツ\n宝くじ  バンジージャンプ\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nマスダは読んだ時・・\n世の中が\nこんなにも遊びで作られているんだ！\nと\n思い知らされました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nゲームクリエイターはもちろん\n多くの作り手さんに\n読んで欲しい１冊です！\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！</div>"}}